          "docs": "Create a managed PostgreSQL database for the organization.\n\nCreates a dedicated database on the customer Cloud SQL instance with:\n- Database name: tenant_{org_id}\n- Role: tenant_{org_id}_rw with ALL PRIVILEGES\n- app_admin user can CONNECT and SET ROLE to access the database\n\nOnly one managed database per organization is allowed.\n\nUse Cases:\n    - Create isolated database for organization data\n    - Store structured data with SQL queries\n    - Enable multi-tenant data isolation"
        },
