          "docs": "Soft-delete an integration credential.\n\nMarks the credential as deleted without physically removing it from the database.\nDeleted credentials are excluded from list queries and cannot be used in workflows.\n\nContext:\n    This endpoint safely removes credentials while preserving audit trail. Common scenarios:\n    - User disconnects an integration from settings UI\n    - Credential compromise detected (delete and recreate)\n    - Integration no longer needed for workflows\n    - OAuth token revoked by"
        },
